---
// Site-wide privacy policy for littlelordgames.com. Covers the website only —
// the Lister desktop app has its own policy at /lister/privacy/ (that is the URL
// given to eBay), and the two are written to complement rather than repeat each
// other.
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How littlelordgames.com handles data: no accounts, no cookies, cookieless analytics only."
  scope="How this website handles data. The Lister desktop app is covered separately."
>
  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This is a static site. There are no accounts, comments, forms, or purchases here.</li>
    <li>It sets no cookies.</li>
    <li>
      It uses <strong>GoatCounter</strong> for cookieless visitor counts. No personal
      data is stored and no profile is built.
    </li>
    <li>Nothing you do here is sold or shared with advertisers.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What is collected</h2>
  <p>
    Every page on this site is a pre-built HTML file. There is nothing to sign in
    to and nothing that asks you for personal information, so the site itself
    collects none.
  </p>
  <p>
    Like any web server, the host records standard request logs (for example the
    page requested and the time) for reliability and security purposes. Those
    logs are not used to build profiles of visitors.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    Page views are counted with
    <a
      href="https://www.goatcounter.com/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">GoatCounter</a
    >, a privacy-focused analytics service. It sets no cookies and does not track
    visitors across sites. It records the page viewed, the referring page,
    approximate browser and screen size, and country — and does not store IP
    addresses. See
    <a
      href="https://www.goatcounter.com/help/privacy"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">GoatCounter's privacy statement</a
    > for the detail.
  </p>
  <p>
    Because no cookies are involved and no personal data is retained, there is no
    consent banner to click through.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2>
  <p>This site sets no cookies. It uses your browser's local storage for one thing:</p>
  <dl>
    <dt><code>theme</code></dt>
    <dd>
      Remembers whether you chose the light or dark colour scheme, so the page
      doesn't flash the wrong one on your next visit. It stays in your browser
      and is never transmitted anywhere.
    </dd>
  </dl>

  <h2>Fonts, search, and other assets</h2>
  <p>
    Fonts are served from this site rather than a font CDN, so loading a page
    doesn't announce your visit to a third party. Site search runs entirely in
    your browser — search queries are never sent to a server.
  </p>

  <h2>Links out</h2>
  <p>
    Some pages link to the LittleLordGames <a
      href={SITE.ebayStoreUrl}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">eBay store</a
    > and to other sites. Once you follow a link, that site's own privacy policy
    applies.
  </p>

  <h2>The Lister desktop app</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="/lister/privacy/">Lister</a> is a desktop application for creating eBay
    listings. It runs on your own computer and is covered by its own policy, which
    also describes the static eBay sign-in page hosted on this domain.
  </p>
</PolicyLayout>
